nodes.body:
@okorzh-amd, thanks for confirming that the #55504 change works in your E2E tests. This branch already carries its fix and both test files as a separate backport. I would like to land that dependency through #55504 first, then remove the backport here. Could you leave a code review on the width bound and regression coverage there?

@dllehr-amd, since you are helping with CI here, could you review or route #55504 and start its CI if the change is ready? The shared routing from #56531 is already in main; #55504 adds the missing query-width bound and its regression tests. Landing it first would let this PR use the fix from main rather than carry a separate copy.

https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/55504

